<section class="section"><div class="container article-body">
<h2>The DQ Sandwich — A Nostalgic Classic</h2>
<p>The DQ Sandwich is one of the most recognizable ice cream sandwiches in American convenience and fast food. Two chocolate-flavored wafers sandwich a thick layer of DQ vanilla soft serve — simple, portable, nostalgic. It requires no stick, no cone, and no melting concern for the first several minutes of eating. At $1.49 and 190 calories, it is the entry-level DQ treat for guests of all ages. Find all DQ classic treats on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
<h2>DQ Sandwich vs. Dilly Bar — Same Price Range, Different Experience</h2>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Format</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>DQ® Sandwich</td><td class="price-cell">$1.49</td><td>190 cal</td><td>Wafer sandwich — no stick, lightest</td></tr><tr><td>Dilly® Bar (Chocolate)</td><td class="price-cell">$1.99</td><td>210 cal</td><td>Round soft serve on stick, chocolate shell</td></tr><tr><td>Buster Bar® Treat</td><td class="price-cell">$2.49</td><td>440 cal</td><td>Soft serve + peanuts + fudge on stick</td></tr><tr><td>Vanilla Soft Serve Cone</td><td class="price-cell">$2.39</td><td>230 cal</td><td>Classic cone — same soft serve, cone format</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h2>Can You Buy DQ Sandwiches to Take Home?</h2>
<p>Yes. DQ Sandwiches are available individually and in multi-packs for take-home. They are stored frozen and can be purchased at the counter to take home and freeze. Some regions also carry DQ novelties including the DQ Sandwich in grocery store freezer sections.</p>
<h2>Is the DQ Sandwich Good Value?</h2>
<p>At $1.49 for a complete, brand-name frozen treat, yes. The DQ Sandwich costs $0.50 less than a Dilly Bar and $0.90 less than a Vanilla Cone for approximately the same amount of soft serve in a different format. It is the best value per calorie on the entire DQ menu and a genuinely good option for guests who want something light, affordable, and satisfying.</p>
