    <h2>The DQ Sandwich — The Most Nostalgic Treat</h2>
    <p>The DQ® Sandwich has been on the menu longer than the Blizzard, longer than the Buster Bar, and longer than most of DQ's food items. Two chocolatey wafers sandwiching DQ vanilla soft serve — $1.49, 190 calories. It is the cheapest frozen treat on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a> and the most nostalgic item for longtime DQ fans.</p>

    <h2>DQ Sandwich vs. Other Novelty Treats</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
